clipdeck (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Shortcut setup for Cinnamon, GNOME, MATE, Xfce and KDE.
  * Packages for Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora, openSUSE and Arch, plus Flatpak,
    Snap and AppImage.
  * Runs with either PySide6 or PyQt6.

